 "n": 5, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "幢", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "大", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "智", "n": 4, "domain_zh": "智慧类"}, {"zh": "寶", "n": 3, "domain_zh": "宝严类"}, {"zh": "音", "n": 3, "domain_zh": "音聲类"}, {"zh": "功", "n": 3, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "海", "n": 3, "domain_zh": "自然类"}, {"zh": "髻", "n": 3, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "明", "n": 3, "domain_zh": "光明类"}], "exclusive_morphs": [], "top_heads": [{"zh": "普", "n": 11}, {"zh": "大", "n": 3}, {"zh": "功", "n": 2}, {"zh": "海", "n": 1}, {"zh": "雲", "n": 1}, {"zh": "善", "n": 1}], "top_tailchs": [{"zh": "幢", "n": 5}, {"zh": "光", "n": 3}, {"zh": "生", "n": 2}, {"zh": "賢", "n": 1}, {"zh": "照", "n": 1}, {"zh": "境", "n": 1}], "word_hits": [{"zh": "普賢", "n": 1}, {"zh": "師子", "n": 1}, {"zh": "如來", "n": 1}, {"zh": "無盡", "n": 1}, {"zh": "無垢", "n": 1}, {"zh": "自在", "n": 1}, {"zh": "勇猛", "n": 1}, {"zh": "精進", "n": 1}], "domains": [{"domain": "affix", "domain_zh": "冠綴类", "n": 19, "pct": 18.8}, {"domain": "luminosity", "domain_zh": "光明类", "n": 18, "pct": 17.8}, {"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 17, "pct": 16.8}, {"domain": "form", "domain_zh": "形相类", "n": 12, "pct": 11.9}, {"domain": "jewel", "domain_zh": "宝严类", "n": 8, "pct": 7.9}, {"domain": "nature", "domain_zh": "自然类", "n": 6, "pct": 5.9}, {"domain": "wisdom", "domain_zh": "智慧类", "n": 5, "pct": 5.0}, {"domain": "sound", "domain_zh": "音聲类", "n": 4, "pct": 4.0}, {"domain": "unassigned", "domain_zh": "未定", "n": 3, "pct": 3.0}, {"domain": "power", "domain_zh": "威势力类", "n": 3, "pct": 3.0}, {"domain": "time", "domain_zh": "時間类", "n": 2, "pct": 2.0}, {"domain": "motion", "domain_zh": "動行类", "n": 2, "pct": 2.0}, {"domain": "space", "domain_zh": "空間类", "n": 1, "pct": 1.0}, {"domain": "number", "domain_zh": "數量类", "n": 1, "pct": 1.0}], "top_domain": {"domain": "affix", "domain_zh": "冠綴类", "n": 19, "pct": 18.8}, "class_tails": ["菩薩摩訶薩"], "note": "实算：20 名 / 1 类，核名均值 5.50（区间 2–7），49 个词素、9 处多字词，\n判读存疑（medium+low）11.9%、须标〔待考〕之 low 仅 2.0%。**本群特有词素仅二：\n普賢、如來**——一为本群上首之真名，一为佛号，二者皆专名而非语汇；余 47 词素\n全部见于他群，即菩萨名号与他群共用同一语料池，此为「同一模板造众名」之最强证据。冠字「普」占 11/20，\n与上首「普賢菩薩摩訶薩」相应；前二名（普賢、普德）亦皆冠「普」。", "note_en": "Measured: 20 names in a single class, mean core length 5.50 (range 2–7),\n49 morphemes, 9 multi-character words; 11.9% of positions medium or low in\nreading, of which only 2.0% sit at the low tier that must be flagged 〔待考〕.\nThe group has **just two exclusive morphemes, 普賢 and 如來** — the leader''s\nown proper name and a Buddha title, both proper nouns rather than vocabulary;\nthe remaining 47 morphemes all occur in other groups, so the bodhisattva\nnames draw on exactly the same lexical pool as the non-human groups. This\nis the strongest evidence that one naming template produced all 414 names.\nThe head character 普 heads 11 of 20 names, matching the leader 普賢菩薩摩訶薩.", "character": "五群中唯一「同类多名」之群：二十名同属菩薩摩訶薩一类，故核名反较八部、天众为长。"}, {"key": "deities", "zh": "异生众·十九类神", "en": "nineteen classes of deities", "n_named": 190, "n_tokens": 1022, "n_classes": 19, "classes": ["執金剛神", "身眾神", "足行神", "道場神", "主城神", "主地神", "主山神", "主林神", "主藥神", "主稼神", "主河神", "主海神", "主水神", "主火神", "主風神", "主空神", "主方神", "主夜神", "主晝神"], "n_core_chars": 1065, "core_len_mean": 5.61, "core_len_min": 3, "core_len_max": 10, "len_hist": {"3": 2, "4": 34, "5": 5, "6": 148, "10": 1}, "n_distinct_morph": 222, "n_word_hits": 40, "n_lowconf": 13, "lowconf_pct": 1.3, "n_medconf": 135, "medconf_pct": 13.2, "top_morphs": [{"zh": "主", "n": 150, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "光", "n": 63, "domain_zh": "光明类"}, {"zh": "普", "n": 33, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "妙", "n": 26, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "華", "n": 26, "domain_zh": "宝严类"}, {"zh": "淨", "n": 26, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "明", "n": 22, "domain_zh": "光明类"}, {"zh": "髻", "n": 17, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "海", "n": 16, "domain_zh": "自然类"}, {"zh": "音", "n": 15, "domain_zh": "音聲类"}, {"zh": "嚴", "n": 14, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "幢", "n": 13, "domain_zh": "形相类"}], "exclusive_morphs": [{"zh": "林", "n": 12}, {"zh": "水", "n": 12}, {"zh": "藥", "n": 11}, {"zh": "風", "n": 11}, {"zh": "空", "n": 11}, {"zh": "方", "n": 11}, {"zh": "城", "n": 10}, {"zh": "稼", "n": 10}, {"zh": "河", "n": 10}, {"zh": "火", "n": 10}], "top_heads": [{"zh": "普", "n": 25}, {"zh": "妙", "n": 13}, {"zh": "大", "n": 8}, {"zh": "光", "n": 7}, {"zh": "淨", "n": 7}, {"zh": "離", "n": 7}], "top_tailchs": [{"zh": "方", "n": 11}, {"zh": "城", "n": 10}, {"zh": "地", "n": 10}, {"zh": "山", "n": 10}, {"zh": "林", "n": 10}, {"zh": "藥", "n": 10}], "word_hits": [{"zh": "十方", "n": 6}, {"zh": "金剛", "n": 5}, {"zh": "吉祥", "n": 5}, {"zh": "無礙", "n": 4}, {"zh": "須彌", "n": 2}, {"zh": "栴檀", "n": 2}, {"zh": "自在", "n": 2}, {"zh": "那羅延", "n": 1}], "domains": [{"domain": "affix", "domain_zh": "冠綴类", "n": 238, "pct": 23.3}, {"domain": "nature", "domain_zh": "自然类", "n": 167, "pct": 16.3}, {"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 134, "pct": 13.1}, {"domain": "luminosity", "domain_zh": "光明类", "n": 114, "pct": 11.2}, {"domain": "motion", "domain_zh": "動行类", "n": 81, "pct": 7.9}, {"domain": "form", "domain_zh": "形相类", "n": 71, "pct": 6.9}, {"domain": "jewel", "domain_zh": "宝严类", "n": 52, "pct": 5.1}, {"domain": "space", "domain_zh": "空間类", "n": 41, "pct": 4.0}, {"domain": "sound", "domain_zh": "音聲类", "n": 29, "pct": 2.8}, {"domain": "time", "domain_zh": "時間类", "n": 28, "pct": 2.7}, {"domain": "power", "domain_zh": "威势力类", "n": 23, "pct": 2.3}, {"domain": "number", "domain_zh": "數量类", "n": 23, "pct": 2.3}, {"domain": "wisdom", "domain_zh": "智慧类", "n": 12, "pct": 1.2}, {"domain": "speech", "domain_zh": "言說类", "n": 4, "pct": 0.4}, {"domain": "body", "domain_zh": "身體類", "n": 3, "pct": 0.3}, {"domain": "unassigned", "domain_zh": "未定", "n": 2, "pct": 0.2}], "top_domain": {"domain": "affix", "domain_zh": "冠綴类", "n": 238, "pct": 23.3}, "class_tails": ["執金剛神", "神", "足行神", "身眾神", "道場神"], "note": "实算：190 名 / 19 类，核名均值 5.61（3–10），222 个词素（为五群最多）、\n40 处多字词，判读存疑 14.7%、low 1.8%。**群特有词素凡 107 个**（为五群最多），\n其中「所主」槽位字十三个（城、林、藥、稼、河、海、水、火、風、空、方、夜、晝）\n确为他群所无，惟「地」「山」二字兼见于八部（毘樓博叉、須彌堅固），\n故非本群所独。旧记「特有词素恰为十五个所主字」不确，今依实算正之：\n即句式的槽位本身成了该群的识别标记——此为 19 类神中 15 类「主X神」\n句式率 100%（150/150）的直接体现。类尾分化为五种（執金剛神／身眾神／\n足行神／道場神／神），恰对应「四类造型神 + 十五类所主神」两型之别。", "note_en": "Measured: 190 names in 19 classes, mean core length 5.61 (3–10), 222\nmorphemes (the most of the five groups), 40 multi-character words; 14.7% of\npositions medium or low, 1.8% at the low tier. The group has **107\nexclusive morphemes — the most of the five** — of which thirteen are the\ngoverned-domain characters 城 林 藥 稼 河 海 水 火 風 空 方 夜 晝, exclusive\nto this group; 地 and 山 also occur in the 八部 (毘樓博叉, 須彌堅固) and so\nare not exclusive here. The earlier claim that the exclusive morphemes were\nexactly the fifteen domain characters does not hold and is corrected to the\nmeasured figure. The slots of the formula themselves did become a signature\nof the group. This is the direct correlate of the 100% formula rate\n(150/150) among the fifteen\n「主X神」 classes. The class tails split into five forms (執金剛神／身眾神／\n足行神／道場神／神), matching the two patterns: four form-deity classes\nagainst fifteen governed-domain classes.", "character": "全篇唯一具严格句式律之群：后十五类「主X神」150/150 名无一例外。"}, {"key": "eight", "zh": "异生众·八部", "en": "eight classes of non-humans", "n_named": 80, "n_tokens": 267, "n_classes": 8, "classes": ["阿脩羅王", "迦樓羅王", "緊那羅王", "摩睺羅伽王", "夜叉王", "諸大龍王", "鳩槃荼王", "乾闥婆王"], "n_core_chars": 302, "core_len_mean": 3.77, "core_len_min": 2, "core_len_max": 8, "len_hist": {"2": 11, "3": 21, "4": 30, "5": 14, "6": 2, "7": 1, "8": 1}, "n_distinct_morph": 124, "n_word_hits": 22, "n_lowconf": 2, "lowconf_pct": 0.7, "n_medconf": 46, "medconf_pct": 17.2, "top_morphs": [{"zh": "嚴", "n": 10, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "妙", "n": 9, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "光", "n": 9, "domain_zh": "光明类"}, {"zh": "普", "n": 9, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "幢", "n": 9, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "大", "n": 8, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "音", "n": 8, "domain_zh": "音聲类"}, {"zh": "莊", "n": 7, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "淨", "n": 6, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "力", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "威势力类"}, {"zh": "目", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "慧", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "智慧类"}], "exclusive_morphs": [{"zh": "固", "n": 3}, {"zh": "壞", "n": 2}, {"zh": "天", "n": 2}, {"zh": "動", "n": 2}, {"zh": "臂", "n": 2}, {"zh": "無邊", "n": 2}], "top_heads": [{"zh": "普", "n": 8}, {"zh": "大", "n": 5}, {"zh": "妙", "n": 4}, {"zh": "無", "n": 4}, {"zh": "毘", "n": 3}, {"zh": "清", "n": 3}], "top_tailchs": [{"zh": "幢", "n": 8}, {"zh": "嚴", "n": 5}, {"zh": "力", "n": 4}, {"zh": "慧", "n": 4}, {"zh": "音", "n": 4}, {"zh": "聲", "n": 3}], "word_hits": [{"zh": "師子", "n": 2}, {"zh": "金剛", "n": 2}, {"zh": "無邊", "n": 2}, {"zh": "羅睺", "n": 1}, {"zh": "毘摩質多羅", "n": 1}, {"zh": "巧幻術", "n": 1}, {"zh": "大眷屬", "n": 1}, {"zh": "因慧", "n": 1}], "domains": [{"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 56, "pct": 21.0}, {"domain": "affix", "domain_zh": "冠綴类", "n": 39, "pct": 14.6}, {"domain": "form", "domain_zh": "形相类", "n": 39, "pct": 14.6}, {"domain": "power", "domain_zh": "威势力类", "n": 27, "pct": 10.1}, {"domain": "motion", "domain_zh": "動行类", "n": 20, "pct": 7.5}, {"domain": "luminosity", "domain_zh": "光明类", "n": 19, "pct": 7.1}, {"domain": "nature", "domain_zh": "自然类", "n": 16, "pct": 6.0}, {"domain": "sound", "domain_zh": "音聲类", "n": 12, "pct": 4.5}, {"domain": "jewel", "domain_zh": "宝严类", "n": 11, "pct": 4.1}, {"domain": "unassigned", "domain_zh": "未定", "n": 9, "pct": 3.4}, {"domain": "wisdom", "domain_zh": "智慧类", "n": 9, "pct": 3.4}, {"domain": "number", "domain_zh": "數量类", "n": 6, "pct": 2.2}, {"domain": "space", "domain_zh": "空間类", "n": 2, "pct": 0.7}, {"domain": "body", "domain_zh": "身體類", "n": 1, "pct": 0.4}, {"domain": "speech", "domain_zh": "言說类", "n": 1, "pct": 0.4}], "top_domain": {"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 56, "pct": 21.0}, "class_tails": ["乾闥婆王", "夜叉王", "摩睺羅伽王", "緊那羅王", "迦樓羅王", "阿脩羅王", "鳩槃荼王", "龍王"], "note": "实算：80 名 / 8 类，核名均值 3.77（2–8），为五群最短；124 个词素、22 处多字词；\n判读存疑（medium+low）18.7% 为五群最高，而须标〔待考〕之 low 仅 1.5%、居五群\n第四——二者方向相反，正见其存疑之性质。其成因是**语料性质而非切分之弊**：\n八部名多以本类或本尊音译立名（羅睺、毘摩質多羅、毘沙門、娑竭羅、持國…），\n音译专名之读法「合理而未证」，故多落 medium 而非 low。后果须明言——**八部的 epithet 分析置信度最低**，\n涉八部之造词结论应加保留；欲比较「群间用字差异」，八部一组宜只看有判读的词素。", "note_en": "Measured: 80 names in 8 classes, mean core length 3.77 (2–8) — the\nshortest of the five groups; 124 morphemes, 22 multi-character words;\n18.7% of positions medium or low, the highest of the five, yet only 1.5% at\nthe low tier that must be flagged — fourth of five. The two measures point\nin opposite directions, which is itself diagnostic. The cause is the nature\nof the material, not a defect of segmentation: many 八部 names are built on\na transliterated class or deity name (羅睺, 毘摩質多羅, 毘沙門, 娑竭羅, 持國),\nwhose readings are plausible but unverified and therefore settle at medium\nrather than low. The\nconsequence must be stated plainly — **the epithet analysis of the 八部 is\nthe least reliable of the five**; any claim about word-building in this\ngroup needs a caveat, and cross-group comparison should read only the\nmorphemes that carry a reading.", "character": "核名最短（均值 3.77）而判读存疑最厚（medium+low 18.7%，五群最高）之群。"}, {"key": "desire", "zh": "异生众·欲界天", "en": "desire-realm gods", "n_named": 73, "n_tokens": 284, "n_classes": 7, "classes": ["月天子", "日天子", "三十三天王", "須夜摩天王", "兜率陀天王", "化樂天王", "他化自在天王"], "n_core_chars": 308, "core_len_mean": 4.22, "core_len_min": 1, "core_len_max": 9, "len_hist": {"1": 2, "2": 5, "3": 18, "4": 9, "5": 33, "6": 3, "7": 2, "9": 1}, "n_distinct_morph": 106, "n_word_hits": 21, "n_lowconf": 3, "lowconf_pct": 1.1, "n_medconf": 42, "medconf_pct": 14.8, "top_morphs": [{"zh": "光", "n": 30, "domain_zh": "光明类"}, {"zh": "明", "n": 17, "domain_zh": "光明类"}, {"zh": "妙", "n": 12, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "幢", "n": 9, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "樂", "n": 8, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "髻", "n": 7, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "嚴", "n": 7, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "普", "n": 6, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "莊", "n": 6, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "勝", "n": 6, "domain_zh": "威势力类"}, {"zh": "華", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "宝严类"}, {"zh": "淨", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "功德类"}], "exclusive_morphs": [{"zh": "因陀羅", "n": 2}], "top_heads": [{"zh": "妙", "n": 7}, {"zh": "普", "n": 5}, {"zh": "可", "n": 5}, {"zh": "光", "n": 4}, {"zh": "最", "n": 4}, {"zh": "華", "n": 3}], "top_tailchs": [{"zh": "明", "n": 15}, {"zh": "幢", "n": 7}, {"zh": "光", "n": 6}, {"zh": "髻", "n": 4}, {"zh": "月", "n": 3}, {"zh": "在", "n": 3}], "word_hits": [{"zh": "可愛", "n": 5}, {"zh": "自在", "n": 4}, {"zh": "須彌", "n": 2}, {"zh": "勇猛", "n": 2}, {"zh": "因陀羅", "n": 2}, {"zh": "不動", "n": 1}, {"zh": "不退轉", "n": 1}, {"zh": "釋迦", "n": 1}], "domains": [{"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 63, "pct": 22.2}, {"domain": "luminosity", "domain_zh": "光明类", "n": 54, "pct": 19.0}, {"domain": "affix", "domain_zh": "冠綴类", "n": 38, "pct": 13.4}, {"domain": "form", "domain_zh": "形相类", "n": 26, "pct": 9.2}, {"domain": "wisdom", "domain_zh": "智慧类", "n": 19, "pct": 6.7}, {"domain": "motion", "domain_zh": "動行类", "n": 17, "pct": 6.0}, {"domain": "power", "domain_zh": "威势力类", "n": 14, "pct": 4.9}, {"domain": "jewel", "domain_zh": "宝严类", "n": 13, "pct": 4.6}, {"domain": "time", "domain_zh": "時間类", "n": 10, "pct": 3.5}, {"domain": "nature", "domain_zh": "自然类", "n": 6, "pct": 2.1}, {"domain": "sound", "domain_zh": "音聲类", "n": 6, "pct": 2.1}, {"domain": "space", "domain_zh": "空間类", "n": 5, "pct": 1.8}, {"domain": "speech", "domain_zh": "言說类", "n": 5, "pct": 1.8}, {"domain": "unassigned", "domain_zh": "未定", "n": 4, "pct": 1.4}, {"domain": "number", "domain_zh": "數量类", "n": 3, "pct": 1.1}, {"domain": "body", "domain_zh": "身體類", "n": 1, "pct": 0.4}], "top_domain": {"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 63, "pct": 22.2}, "class_tails": ["天子", "天王"], "note": "实算：73 名 / 7 类，核名均值 4.25（2–9），108 个词素、21 处多字词，\n判读存疑（medium+low）16.4%、low 1.7%。类尾仅「天子」「天王」两种，无所主标记，\n故与十九类神之严格句式律成对照：同为天王而一为填空式、一为自由式。\n群特有词素 17 个（分、句、察、得、悟、慈、敬、正、滿、界、總、蘂、議、門、\n子、因陀羅、釋迦），多于八部之 5、少于天众之 107。其中「因陀羅」为帝释别名\n（Śakra），见于三十三天王「釋迦因陀羅天王」与他化自在天王\n「因陀羅力妙莊嚴光明天王」二处；旧记「仅见于三十三天王」不确，今正之。\n本群「光」「明」二词素之和 47，为群内最高，显示其名号仍以光明语汇为主调。", "note_en": "Measured: 73 names in 7 classes, mean core length 4.25 (2–9), 108\nmorphemes, 21 multi-character words; 16.4% medium or low, 1.7% at the low\ntier. Class tails are only 「天子」 and 「天王」, with no governed-domain\nmarker, so this group stands in contrast to the strict formula of the\nnineteen deity classes: both are 天王, but one is fill-in-the-blank and\nthe other free. It has 17 exclusive morphemes (分 句 察 得 悟 慈 敬 正 滿 界\n總 蘂 議 門 子 因陀羅 釋迦) — more than the 八部''s 5, fewer than the devas''\n107. 因陀羅 is a name of Śakra occurring in **two** classes, the\nTrayastriṃśa (釋迦因陀羅天王) and the Nirmāṇarati\n(因陀羅力妙莊嚴光明天王); the earlier claim that it appeared solely in the\nTrayastriṃśa does not hold and is corrected. 光 and 明 together reach 47 occurrences\nwithin the group, the highest of any pair, so luminosity still dominates\nthe group''s vocabulary.", "character": "以「天子」「天王」二尾统摄，全群无句式律之群。"}, {"key": "form", "zh": "异生众·色界天", "en": "form-realm gods", "n_named": 51, "n_tokens": 203, "n_classes": 5, "classes": ["大梵天王", "光音天王", "遍淨天王", "廣果天王", "大自在天王"], "n_core_chars": 223, "core_len_mean": 4.37, "core_len_min": 2, "core_len_max": 7, "len_hist": {"2": 2, "3": 11, "4": 13, "5": 18, "6": 5, "7": 2}, "n_distinct_morph": 62, "n_word_hits": 20, "n_lowconf": 0, "lowconf_pct": 0.0, "n_medconf": 24, "medconf_pct": 11.8, "top_morphs": [{"zh": "光", "n": 21, "domain_zh": "光明类"}, {"zh": "音", "n": 12, "domain_zh": "音聲类"}, {"zh": "明", "n": 9, "domain_zh": "光明类"}, {"zh": "樂", "n": 8, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "淨", "n": 8, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "慧", "n": 7, "domain_zh": "智慧类"}, {"zh": "自在", "n": 7, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "眼", "n": 6, "domain_zh": "形相类"}, {"zh": "清", "n": 6, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "可愛", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "功德类"}, {"zh": "妙", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}, {"zh": "最", "n": 5, "domain_zh": "冠綴类"}], "exclusive_morphs": [{"zh": "惟", "n": 3}, {"zh": "法", "n": 2}], "top_heads": [{"zh": "可", "n": 5}, {"zh": "善", "n": 4}, {"zh": "普", "n": 4}, {"zh": "清", "n": 4}, {"zh": "最", "n": 4}, {"zh": "光", "n": 3}], "top_tailchs": [{"zh": "音", "n": 8}, {"zh": "光", "n": 7}, {"zh": "明", "n": 6}, {"zh": "眼", "n": 6}, {"zh": "幢", "n": 4}, {"zh": "在", "n": 3}], "word_hits": [{"zh": "自在", "n": 7}, {"zh": "可愛", "n": 5}, {"zh": "無垢", "n": 2}, {"zh": "尸棄", "n": 1}, {"zh": "十方", "n": 1}, {"zh": "須彌", "n": 1}, {"zh": "愛樂", "n": 1}, {"zh": "不動", "n": 1}], "domains": [{"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 59, "pct": 29.1}, {"domain": "luminosity", "domain_zh": "光明类", "n": 36, "pct": 17.7}, {"domain": "affix", "domain_zh": "冠綴类", "n": 23, "pct": 11.3}, {"domain": "wisdom", "domain_zh": "智慧类", "n": 21, "pct": 10.3}, {"domain": "sound", "domain_zh": "音聲类", "n": 12, "pct": 5.9}, {"domain": "form", "domain_zh": "形相类", "n": 10, "pct": 4.9}, {"domain": "motion", "domain_zh": "動行类", "n": 10, "pct": 4.9}, {"domain": "power", "domain_zh": "威势力类", "n": 9, "pct": 4.4}, {"domain": "speech", "domain_zh": "言說类", "n": 8, "pct": 3.9}, {"domain": "nature", "domain_zh": "自然类", "n": 5, "pct": 2.5}, {"domain": "space", "domain_zh": "空間类", "n": 3, "pct": 1.5}, {"domain": "number", "domain_zh": "數量类", "n": 2, "pct": 1.0}, {"domain": "dharma", "domain_zh": "法教类", "n": 2, "pct": 1.0}, {"domain": "time", "domain_zh": "時間类", "n": 2, "pct": 1.0}, {"domain": "unassigned", "domain_zh": "未定", "n": 1, "pct": 0.5}], "top_domain": {"domain": "virtue", "domain_zh": "功德类", "n": 59, "pct": 29.1}, "class_tails": ["天王"], "note": "实算：51 名 / 5 类，核名均值 4.37（2–7），62 个词素（五群最少）、\n20 处多字词，判读存疑（medium+low）12.8%、low 1.0%，二者皆为五群最低。\n功德类占 29.1% 为五群之最，\n与本群多以德相立名相应（「清淨名稱天王」「自在名稱光天王」「最勝見天王」）。\n「自在」复合词 7 见、「可愛」5 见，为本群最显著的两个多字词。\n群间比较上，本群与欲界天之 Jaccard 最高（0.362）、域分布距离最小（16.7%），\n即两天之造词实践最为接近。", "note_en": "Measured: 51 names in 5 classes, mean core length 4.37 (2–7), 63 morphemes\n(the fewest of the five), 20 multi-character words; 12.8% medium or low and\n1.0% at the low tier, both the lowest of the five. The merit-virtue domain\ntakes 29.1%